.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123491","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123491.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123491.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-14T21:29:13Z"},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n1. Open a scene.\r\n2. Close it.\r\n3. Rename/move it.\r\n4. Ctrl + Shift + T -> error\r\n5. Also your Scenes > Recently Opened has stale entry\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThe above problems are fixed by using UID instead of path to store recent scenes (note that recent and recently closed scenes are 2 different things, but this PR fixes both). Due to the nature of UIDs, the recent scene menu is updated every time it's opened; this also allowed to cleanup the list of invalid scenes, so opening a recent scene that no longer exists should not be possible anymore. Also fixed an error when trying to reopen last scene and it was removed; the invalid entry is deleted instead of erroring forever.\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repi